on":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.4\n\n### System information\n\nAndroid 12, Kirin990 5G, ARM Mali-G76 MP16\n\n### Issue description\n\nCurrently the glow implementation of both Forward+ and Mobile renderers has horrible appearance and color banding on Android, especially at higher `glow_level`. This also happends in 2D HDR glow. And viewport debanding or anti-aliasing doesn't work for it. However, the same glow effect looks good on PC.\n \nThe Screenshots with Mobile renderer. Android is on top, PC is below :\n<details>\n  <summary>glow level 7</summary>\n<img src=https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3a9015f6-2ba2-4a6a-98fc-2db7485edb19>\n<img src=https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4c08f969-dcc2-4e28-b635-652dcd5878be>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>glow level 6</summary>\n<img src=https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/657e5949-91fa-4413-bb6d-ee899f4689cf>\n<img src=https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8f7fd4b0-85fa-4069-a11e-c8de2c6670e1>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>glow level 5</summary>\n<img src=https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4dcbe3d1-a831-4115-92e5-1bbc97b8ac58>\n<img src=https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cfecb1e0-f1e4-4787-b17b-5b21c5b63655>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>glow level 4</summary>\n<img src=https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f9b15b58-6217-4775-ac9a-dad043c46990>\n<img src=https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0cf48717-2249-4309-9ea7-9c0eb49e2b51>\n</details>\n\n<details>\n  <summary>glow level 3</summary>\n<img src=https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/09494087-c268-441f-98fd-40d23dae9aee>\n<img src=https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/343e1d82-7c26-4386-9c86-7f1b9a532dbf>\n</details>\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a 3d scene, or 2d scene with 2D HDR enabled , add a WorldEnvironment and enable glow, run the scene on Android. \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[MobileGlowBand.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19056453/MobileGlowBand.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"skyace65","id":6080368,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwODAzNjg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6080368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyace65","html_url":"https://github.com/skyace65","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyace65/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyace65/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyace65/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyace65/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyace65/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyace65/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyace65/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyace65/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skyace65/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103512/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103512/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}